  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每个世界都有独立的喝啤酒小游戏，必须掌握不同节奏才能维持生命并继续前进。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Every world has a unique beer drinking minigame. Some are easier than others... you'll need to master them all to stay alive and get to where you're going!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3912370/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "操控普通人John Beer在疯狂世界中跳跃、滑行和加速，穿过程序生成的高速路线。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Play as the profoundly average John Beer to jump, slide, and boost your way through crazy worlds!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3912370/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "逃离世界后获得Bottlecaps能力升级，最多混搭3个，从啤酒护盾到霰弹枪皆可加入构筑。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Escaping a world will grant you an upgrade to your abilities, known as Bottlecaps ! Mix and match up to three of them to your liking to blow past future worlds with ease!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3912370/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
